      "text": "**Analyzing noisy images**\n\nI need to inspect noisy images to identify a central structure across nine slices, each being 448 squares and with a specific field of view. I’m trying to reason about continuity and changes in the images. At the center of each slice, I'm noticing subtleties, such as potential circular shapes or dark areas. I aim to develop a clearer understanding of any vessels or nodules present by analyzing pixel patterns sequentially across each slice.",
